<\/div>","Email":"taugania@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1244038057,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218080.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"taugania","Id":218080,"Name":"taugania","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42892,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"543e2636bb4e1a29407f225d3a275a4d","RawContent":"Thanks for the great comments - I ended up making 15 of these bags - 1 per couple or single traveler. Unfortunately I overbought, so I will be posting some of my extras for sale once everything is over!\n \n Cost...I probably have about $20 in each one - the most expensive items were the photo albums - about $5 and the Pashminas $4. I was originally only going to give the photo albums, but I kept finding more ideas. \n \n Thanks again for all the positive comments!","Attachments":[],"Id":859565,"PostDate":1253836002,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the great comments - I ended up making 15 of these bags - 1 per couple or single traveler. Unfortunately I overbought, so I will be posting some of my extras for sale once everything is over!<br \/> <br \/> Cost...I probably have about $20 in each one - the most expensive items were the photo albums - about $5 and the Pashminas $4. I was originally only going to give the photo albums, but I kept finding more ideas. <br \/> <br \/> Thanks again for all the positive comments!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heidemoeller@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1233715241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214606.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"uconncruiser","Id":214606,"Name":"uconncruiser","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":75,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
