{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":42892,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ae8d90e822f029bc747f376d517209b","RawContent":"With a couple of weeks to go - my OOT bags are finally done! Thank you to all the BDW brides who have posted their great ideas and templates! \n \n I have included the following in the bags:\n \n - Pashmina\n - &amp;quot;Wedding Weekend Survival Kit&amp;quot; - basically first aid kit with Tylenol and Pepto Bismol along with Purell, stain wipes, and chapstick\n - Photo Frame picture album with pictures of the church and hotel in the album \n - Spanish for Dummies\n - Tissues\n - Playing Cards \n - Notepad w\/ Pen\n - On the OOT bag tag, we included the 2009 Puerto Rico quarter as well!\n - I plan to include a few brochures of things to do in PR as well but I will include those when I get down there.\n \n For the wedding favors at the dinner reception, we will be giving our guests 2 bacardi rum nips.\n \n I had a great time putting these together and have realized I actually have a &amp;quot;creative&amp;quot; side!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i618.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt269\/uconncruiser\/OOTBag1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i618.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt269\/uconncruiser\/SurvivalKit1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":858166,"PostDate":1253755341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                With a couple of weeks to go - my OOT bags are finally done! Thank you to all the BDW brides who have posted their great ideas and templates! <br \/> <br \/> I have included the following in the bags:<br \/> <br \/> - Pashmina<br \/> - \"Wedding Weekend Survival Kit\" - basically first aid kit with Tylenol and Pepto Bismol along with Purell, stain wipes, and chapstick<br \/> - Photo Frame picture album with pictures of the church and hotel in the album <br \/> - Spanish for Dummies<br \/> - Tissues<br \/> - Playing Cards <br \/> - Notepad w\/ Pen<br \/> - On the OOT bag tag, we included the 2009 Puerto Rico quarter as well!<br \/> - I plan to include a few brochures of things to do in PR as well but I will include those when I get down there.<br \/> <br \/> For the wedding favors at the dinner reception, we will be giving our guests 2 bacardi rum nips.<br \/> <br \/> I had a great time putting these together and have realized I actually have a \"creative\" side!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i618.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt269\/uconncruiser\/OOTBag1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i618.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt269\/uconncruiser\/SurvivalKit1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heidemoeller@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1233715241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214606.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"For