Or are you going to divy them up once you are down there?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Ah, good question! I guess maybe we should assemble upon arrival?","Attachments":[],"Id":192352,"PostDate":1202758668,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Tlseege<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Are the individual bagies of pills going to be OK through customs? Or are you going to divy them up once you are down there?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Ah, good question! I guess maybe we should assemble upon arrival?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/Slide1-7.jpg\">http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...v\/Slide1-7.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"scwinetastings@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177639140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207379.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"foxytv","Id":207379,"Name":"foxytv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11258,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e1174edd0c74b4a6f180d12fc340d96","RawContent":"Ok, I decided I&#039;ll divy it up when I get there. I don&#039;t want to risk a problem at customs. I&#039;ll tape up the envelopes in advance so it won&#039;t take long to divy. I&#039;ll probably need to come in out of the sun at some point. \n \n I&#039;m going to add the tip to the first post so others know.","Attachments":[],"Id":192363,"PostDate":1202759214,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok, I decided I'll divy it up when I get there. I don't want to risk a problem at customs. I'll tape up the envelopes in advance so it won't take long to divy. I'll probably need to come in out of the sun at some point. <br \/> <br \/> I'm going to add the tip to the first post so others know.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morganleigh03@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.177.182.183","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1182646980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rodent","Id":207489,"Name":"rodent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11258,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0813bb605142399af14b3270b50f3ad2","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Morgan&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Ok, I decided I&#039;ll divy it up when I get there. I don&#039;t want to risk a problem at customs. I&#039;ll tape up the envelopes in advance so it won&#039;t take long to divy. I&#039;ll probably need to come in out of the sun at some point. \n \n I&#039;m going to add the tip to the first post so others know.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Good idea. My Mom is going to help me put together everything for the OOT bags when we get there. \n \n We will either do it all in one sitting or a few each day, since we have people coming in on different days and are having a welcome reception for the &amp;quot;newbies&#039; each evening. At least we won&#039;t have to do them all at once if it&#039;s too time consuming.","Attachments":[],"Id":192371,"PostDate":1202759673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Morgan<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Ok, I decided I'll divy it up when I get there. I don't want to risk a problem at customs. I'll tape up the envelopes in advance so it won't take long to divy. I'll probably need to come in out of the sun at some point. <br \/> <br \/> I'm going to add the tip to the first post so others know.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Good idea. My Mom is going to help me put together everything for the OOT bags when we get there. <br \/> <br \/> We will either do it all in one sitting or a few each day, since we have people coming in on different days and are having a welcome reception for the \"newbies' each evening. At least we won't have to do them all at once if it's too time consuming.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/Slide1-7.jpg\">http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...v\/Slide1-7.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"scwinetastings@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177639140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207379.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"foxytv","Id":207379,"Name":"foxytv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11258,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e70f9e0810c4dbbebd921b8d936d75b1","RawContent":"Morgan, can I hire you? My budget and FI sure would appreciate it?!","Attachments":[],"Id":192429,"PostDate":1202762860,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Morgan, can I hire you? My budget and FI sure would appreciate it?!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carlydorazio@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.92.56.95","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177530900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207375.jpg?_r=1414982962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"boscobel","Id":207375,"Name":"boscobel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11258,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e7a98e09eb30ff1abf5f12446e2a4a7","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;carly&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Morgan, can I hire you? My budget and FI sure would appreciate it?!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Ha! My first money saving tip as your wedding planner is to advise you not to hire me. Just get all my templates for free. I post it all.\n \n I&#039;m just naturally always on a budget. I feel like with some creativity I can make the wedding really nice without spending too much. I keep a running tab on an excel spreadsheet &amp;amp; add every little thing. I&#039;m actually $500 under budget and I&#039;ve done way more stuff than I originally planned on.","Attachments":[],"Id":192447,"PostDate":1202763701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>carly<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Morgan, can I hire you? My budget and FI sure would appreciate it?!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Ha! My first money saving tip as your wedding planner is to advise you not to hire me. Just get all my templates for free. I post it all.<br \/> <br \/> I'm just naturally always on a budget. I feel like with some creativity I can make the wedding really nice without spending too much. I keep a running tab on an excel spreadsheet & add every little thing. I'm actually $500 under budget and I've done way more stuff than I originally planned on.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morganleigh03@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.177.182.183","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1182646980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rodent","Id":207489,"Name":"rodent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11258,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f528ccf2c55f5fa4ca96626f9f559586","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Morgan&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Ha! My first money saving tip as your wedding planner is to advise you not to hire me. Just get all my templates for free. I post it all.\n \n I&#039;m just naturally always on a budget. I feel like with some creativity I can make the wedding really nice without spending too much. I keep a running tab on an excel spreadsheet &amp;amp; add every little thing. I&#039;m actually $500 under budget and I&#039;ve done way more stuff than I originally planned on.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Well thank goodness for your creativity, craftiness &amp;amp; budget consciousness. That was a mouthful...LOL...Your ideas are just too cool &amp;amp; extrememly helpful. Thanks for always sharing!&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":192455,"PostDate":1202764065,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Morgan<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Ha! My first money saving tip as your wedding planner is to advise you not to hire me. Just get all my templates for free. I post it all.<br \/> <br \/> I'm just naturally always on a budget. I feel like with some creativity I can make the wedding really nice without spending too much. I keep a running tab on an excel spreadsheet & add every little thing. I'm actually $500 under budget and I've done way more stuff than I originally planned on.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Well thank goodness for your creativity, craftiness & budget consciousness. That was a mouthful...LOL...Your ideas are just too cool & extrememly helpful. Thanks for always sharing!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvega98@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.167.150.138","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1188401100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207685.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JUSTUSTWO","Id":207685,"Name":"JUSTUSTWO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":11258,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6edac31f065353566d065846d55f124b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JUSTUSTWO&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Well thank goodness for your creativity, craftiness &amp;amp; budget consciousness. That was a mouthful...LOL...Your ideas are just too cool &amp;amp; extrememly helpful. Thanks for always sharing!&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks. The 3 Cs of wedding planning :)","Attachments":[],"Id":192481,"PostDate":1202764365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n               