Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.180.194.174","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80008,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b211783a2b6bce5f7a3c1914dadb04cf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello! &amp;nbsp;Recently engaged and planning on a beach wedding in May 2017. &amp;nbsp;We plan to rent a condo on the beach and use a planning company to set up the arbor. &amp;nbsp;We will have less than 10 people in attendance, so no chairs. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My dad will likely walk me down the aisle, but from where?! &amp;nbsp;Does everyone watch us walk all the way from the parking lot\/condo to the altar? &amp;nbsp;This seems so awkward! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have ideas on how to make this less awkward?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912150,"PostDate":1458760276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello! \u00a0Recently engaged and planning on a beach wedding in May 2017. \u00a0We plan to rent a condo on the beach and use a planning company to set up the arbor. \u00a0We will have less than 10 people in attendance, so no chairs. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My dad will likely walk me down the aisle, but from where?! \u00a0Does everyone watch us walk all the way from the parking lot\/condo to the altar? \u00a0This seems so awkward! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone have ideas on how to make this less awkward?<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ekflannery@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.180.194.174","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1458759451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"itscaramel","Id":286552,"Name":"itscaramel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.21.215.117","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80008,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3f02e88d7d81727ce876aacf3c993f1","RawContent":"@[member=\"itscaramel\"] I know a few hotels that we stayed at had something similar to a path leading to the beach... One hotel in particular had a back entrance that kind of connected to the path. Good luck! Congratulations!","Attachments":[],"Id":1912151,"PostDate":1458760843,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286552\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286552-itscaramel\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">itscaramel<\/span><\/a> I know a few hotels that we stayed at had something similar to a path leading to the beach... One hotel in particular had a back entrance that kind of connected to the path. Good luck! Congratulations!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"atwater7@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.240.19.233","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389463919,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276017.jpg?_r=1452312783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":139,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LADYJUSTICE","Id":276017,"Name":"LADYJUSTICE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80008,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89f3306eb47fd0e1d50a49269b0070d0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"itscaramel\" post=\"1912150\" timestamp=\"1458778276\"]\nHello!  Recently engaged and planning on a beach wedding in May 2017.  We plan to rent a condo on the beach and use a planning company to set up the arbor.  We will have less than 10 people in attendance, so no chairs.  \nMy dad will likely walk me down the aisle, but from where?!  Does everyone watch us walk all the way from the parking lot\/condo to the altar?  This seems so awkward!  \nDoes anyone have ideas on how to make this less awkward?\nThank you!!![\/quote]@[member=\"itscaramel\"] congrats on your engagement, usually the walk would start from where your guests can see you.  if you are coming out of the car in the parking lot no-one can see you then.  hope this helps.\n\nHappy Planning!\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1912156,"PostDate":1458775291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>itscaramel, on 23 March 2016 - 07:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello! \u00a0Recently engaged and planning on a beach wedding in May 2017. \u00a0We plan to rent a condo on the beach and use a planning company to set up the arbor. \u00a0We will have less than 10 people in attendance, so no chairs. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My dad will likely walk me down the aisle, but from where?! \u00a0Does everyone watch us walk all the way from the parking lot\/condo to the altar? \u00a0This seems so awkward! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone have ideas on how to make this less awkward?<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286552\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286552-itscaramel\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">itscaramel<\/span><\/a> congrats on your engagement, usually the walk would start from where your guests can see you. \u00a0if you are coming out of the car in the parking lot no-one can see you then. \u00a0hope this helps.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.128.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80008,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5d0a10f7b6b7829042fc4a2db3d1cac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your dw next May, itscarmel!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll find lots of great help, ideas + support from everyone here - plus tons of resources for answers to your planning questions - so well done on joining up :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve seen all kinds of entrances for the Brides we&#039;ve captured on their Big Walk down the \"aisle\" like some of these.....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq&#039;&gt;Wedding Story Albums link&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_683733f215d144939c7f75304b4b2efe.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_800,h_533,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_683733f215d144939c7f75304b4b2efe.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_683733f215d144939c7f75304b4b2efe.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_6daff621250e4074959a5519cbc4b28e.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_6daff621250e4074959a5519cbc4b28e.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_6daff621250e4074959a5519cbc4b28e.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_98d4dabd7051452b9448d5af19bc9d28.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_554,h_831,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_98d4dabd7051452b9448d5af19bc9d28.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_98d4dabd7051452b9448d5af19bc9d28.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research - enjoy your journey, and All the BEST with your process - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912173,"PostDate":1458825135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your dw next May, itscarmel!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find lots of great help, ideas + support from everyone here - plus tons of resources for answers to your planning questions - so well done on joining up <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've seen all kinds of entrances for the Brides we've captured on their Big Walk down the \"aisle\" like some of these.....taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Story Albums link<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_683733f215d144939c7f75304b4b2efe.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_800,h_533,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_683733f215d144939c7f75304b4b2efe.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_683733f215d144939c7f75304b4b2efe.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_6daff621250e4074959a5519cbc4b28e.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_6daff621250e4074959a5519cbc4b28e.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_6daff621250e4074959a5519cbc4b28e.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_98d4dabd7051452b9448d5af19bc9d28.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_554,h_831,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_98d4dabd7051452b9448d5af19bc9d28.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_98d4dabd7051452b9448d5af19bc9d28.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research - enjoy your journey, and All the BEST with your process - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80008","Title":"Beach Wedding - Walking Down The \"aisle?\"","LastPostDate":1458825135},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
