        font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think another thing that's really important to planning a beach wedding is to do your research. Read reviews and make sure you're booking vendors who are well respected and trusted. If you want some other suggestions this blog is great!\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bridalblueprint.com\/blogs\/planning-a-destination-wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bridalblu...ination-wedding<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lyssm929@insightbb.com","IpAddress":"99.125.232.32","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447708654,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285356.jpg?_r=1448934800","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LyssM929","Id":285356,"Name":"LyssM929","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"384","Title":"Planning for a Beach Wedding - A Guide to Beach Wedding","LastPostDate":1447709611},"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
