Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.29.21.179","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80013,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb2ad0d2ce37108621b6590bc9c15fe6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello lovely BDW brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am super new to the forum, and recently got engaged (woop!) :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My partner is Dominican - we are living in Toronto - and we are hoping to get married in Punta Cana. We are looking at doing it off-site from a hotel, hopefully a beach front restaurant.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So far we have The Jellyfish in mind, it looks gorgeous! Does anyone have any experiences with The Jellyfish or other similar recommendations?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any advice, experiences or info you guys could share would be so very appreciated.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are hoping to get married December 2017\/Jan 2018.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All the best to you ladies!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sophia :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912252,"PostDate":1459162398,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello lovely BDW brides!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am super new to the forum, and recently got engaged (woop!) <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My partner is Dominican - we are living in Toronto - and we are hoping to get married in Punta Cana. We are looking at doing it off-site from a hotel, hopefully a beach front restaurant.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So far we have The Jellyfish in mind, it looks gorgeous! Does anyone have any experiences with The Jellyfish or other similar recommendations?<\/p>\n<p>Any advice, experiences or info you guys could share would be so very appreciated.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are hoping to get married December 2017\/Jan 2018.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All the best to you ladies!!<\/p>\n<p>Sophia <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sophiaa47@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"209.29.21.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1459161716,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286588.jpg?_r=1459191027","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"2110Sophia","Id":286588,"Name":"2110Sophia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.7.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":80013,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52257d40a1a0a42a5bc3da5a8d3a7646","RawContent":"Congratulations... I am getting married in Punta Cana in July 2016. The place your looking at looks really nice. We are getting married at a hotel there.. if you have any good ideas please if you can pass them on to me too... thanks and happy planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1912261,"PostDate":1459168098,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations... I am getting married in Punta Cana in July 2016. The place your looking at looks really nice. We are getting married at a hotel there.. if you have any good ideas please if you can pass them on to me too... thanks and happy planning \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440276410,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.128.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80013,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Today, 01:11 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1459170712,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7f6c8f10730cd53efb5df3482314ca7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the boards, Sophia and lorishultz2016, and CONGRATS on your engagements and upcoming destination weddings!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a link to what others are saying about the resort you&#039;re considering: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=0a723498cc49c81f29488eeaaad158bb&amp;amp;app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&amp;amp;gsc.q=Jellyfish&#039;&gt;Jellyfish threads link&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find the answers you&#039;re looking for, and wishing you all the best with your research and wonderful journey ahead - ENJOY!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....leaving you with some visual inspiration of magical beach wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq&#039;&gt;Riviera Maya Resorts: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_cc2e942322f1438eb7cbd589178993a3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_cc2e942322f1438eb7cbd589178993a3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_cc2e942322f1438eb7cbd589178993a3.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a4b786b8383543f3b925cdd8eefad2fd.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a4b786b8383543f3b925cdd8eefad2fd.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a4b786b8383543f3b925cdd8eefad2fd.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3da4a081aa754f498df80170e7a79770.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3da4a081aa754f498df80170e7a79770.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3da4a081aa754f498df80170e7a79770.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912264,"PostDate":1459170680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the boards, Sophia and lorishultz2016, and CONGRATS on your engagements and upcoming destination weddings!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a link to what others are saying about the resort you're considering: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?s=0a723498cc49c81f29488eeaaad158bb&app=googlecse#gsc.tab=0&gsc.q=Jellyfish' class='bbc_url' title=''>Jellyfish threads link<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Hope you find the answers you're looking for, and wishing you all the best with your research and wonderful journey ahead - ENJOY!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....leaving you with some visual inspiration of magical beach wedding moments that matter we captured in our magnificent <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Riviera Maya Resorts: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_cc2e942322f1438eb7cbd589178993a3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_cc2e942322f1438eb7cbd589178993a3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_cc2e942322f1438eb7cbd589178993a3.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a4b786b8383543f3b925cdd8eefad2fd.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a4b786b8383543f3b925cdd8eefad2fd.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a4b786b8383543f3b925cdd8eefad2fd.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3da4a081aa754f498df80170e7a79770.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3da4a081aa754f498df80170e7a79770.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3da4a081aa754f498df80170e7a79770.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style